{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-full-article-js","path":"/content/2020/dont-finish-that-book/","result":{"data":{"markdownRemark":{"html":"<br/>\n<p>It is a skill to understand when to stop reading a book and switch to another one. Not finishing a book is not a sign of failure, rather it is a sign that you value your time even more. Reading non-fiction books in a serial way, i.e. one book after another is also quite inefficient. Reading a few books and jumping between them helps keep the interest level high. However, there might be advantages of sticking with a book in the case of fiction, especially when the story draws you into a whole another world and you develop a connection with the plot and the characters.</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Don't finish that book","date":"2020-10-17","condensed":"","type":"notes","published":true,"displaydate":"October 17, 2020","tags":["Learning","Thinking"]},"excerpt":"It is a skill to understand when to stop reading a book and switch to another one. Not finishing a book is not a sign of failure, rather it…"},"allMarkdownRemark":{"group":[{"fieldValue":"AI","totalCount":7},{"fieldValue":"Automotive","totalCount":1},{"fieldValue":"Biology","totalCount":10},{"fieldValue":"Brain","totalCount":2},{"fieldValue":"Business","totalCount":31},{"fieldValue":"Crypto","totalCount":6},{"fieldValue":"Data","totalCount":12},{"fieldValue":"Design","totalCount":2},{"fieldValue":"EV","totalCount":2},{"fieldValue":"Economics","totalCount":18},{"fieldValue":"Economy","totalCount":17},{"fieldValue":"Entrepreneurship","totalCount":7},{"fieldValue":"Environment","totalCount":2},{"fieldValue":"Evolution","totalCount":2},{"fieldValue":"Finance","totalCount":36},{"fieldValue":"Future","totalCount":11},{"fieldValue":"Gene","totalCount":2},{"fieldValue":"Hardware","totalCount":5},{"fieldValue":"Internet","totalCount":16},{"fieldValue":"Investing","totalCount":24},{"fieldValue":"Learning","totalCount":5},{"fieldValue":"Lifestyle","totalCount